OL,3,GNEWSAFilm shows danger of laughing gas
OL,4,Ause behind wheel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA short film has been made in Leeds as
OL,7,Fpart of a campaign to warn young people
OL,8,Fabout drug-driving.
OL,10,FThe film, produced by University of
OL,11,FLeeds students, shows the risks of
OL,12,Fdriving after inhaling nitrous oxide,
OL,13,Falso known as laughing gas, which has
OL,14,Fbeen controlled as a Class C drug since
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FCalled NOS, after the slang word for
OL,18,Fthe substance, it was created after
OL,19,Fstaff at the Harehills-based Junior
OL,20,FSports Hub warned that drug-driving had
OL,21,Fbecome a growing concern among young
OL,22,Fpeople and families.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
