OL,3,GNEWSAFilm shows danger of laughing gas
OL,4,Ause behind wheel
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuna Berger, the film's writer and
OL,7,Fdirector, said it aimed to show how the
OL,8,Fconsequences of drug use could affect
OL,9,Fan entire family: "In the film,
OL,10,Feveryone is a victim. No one comes out
OL,11,Fas a better person."
